---
import { siteConfig, url } from '../../lib/config';

// level 0-5 → 8 段像素条（MAX_SEGMENTS 与 global.css .skill-bar 对齐）：
// filled = floor(level / 5 * MAX_SEGMENTS)，与数值语义一致（3/5→4/8 格 50%、4/5→6/8 格 75%）
const MAX_SEGMENTS = 8;
---

<section id="skills">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      <span class="num text-pixel">03</span><span class="text-pixel">SKILLS</span> <span class="text-dim">技能履历</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="pixel-panel">
      <ul class="skills">
        {
          siteConfig.skills.map((skill) => {
            const filled = Math.floor((skill.level / 5) * MAX_SEGMENTS);
            return (
              <li class="row">
                <span class="label">{skill.name}</span>
                <span class="skill-bar" aria-label={`${skill.name}: ${skill.level}/5`}>
                  {
                    Array.from({ length: MAX_SEGMENTS }, (_, i) => (
                      <i class={i < filled ? 'on' : ''}></i>
                    ))
                  }
                </span>
                <span class="level text-pixel"
                  >{skill.level}<span class="sep">/</span>5</span
                >
              </li>
            );
          })
        }
      </ul>
      <p class="note text-dim">
        以上为自评概览（self-assessment）；证据链：方法论三篇
        <a href={url('blog/2026-08-29-rpa-migration-methodology')}>RPA 迁移</a> /
        <a href={url('blog/2026-08-29-data-pipeline-engineering')}>数据管道</a> /
        <a href={url('blog/2026-08-29-reversing-unknown-internal-systems')}>黑盒逆向</a>
        （均 Python 生态）+ 本站工程（TypeScript / Astro / Web Audio），
        RPA 项另持影刀高级 RPA 技能证书；AI 辅助开发见 RPA 迁移方法论篇，
        代码见 <a href="https://github.com/Matt-qwq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .skills {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .level {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--gb-2);
  }

  /* 斜杠压暗 + 留空：像素字体下「4/5」易被读成「45」 */
  .level .sep {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-inline: 0.2em;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  /* 脚注链接可见性：accent 色 + 2px 下划线（fix 无下划线+最亮色倒挂），hover 继承全局变 gb-3 */
  .note a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    }
    .label {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>